+        "implemented mean-projection recovery plus Section 3 exact dual check is "
+        "O(Nm+N log N+N^3) (about 55,000 counted exact operations and under one "
+        "second at shipping N=30); the symmetry route uses 300 arithmetic and "
+        "comparison operations but must be recognized and executed without tools."
+    ),
+    "max_answer_tokens": 50,
+}
