Implemented the native Track B generator based on the paper’s Section 3 SDP dual certificate construction. The paper explicitly provides an efficient SDP recovery route, so Track A would be inappropriate. [Source paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1505.04778).

Files:

- [gen_1505_04778.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1505.04778/gen_1505_04778.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1505.04778/selftest_report.json)
